      "en": {
        "contextHtml": "",
        "questionHtml": "<div class=\"question-item exercise\" data-print-keep=\"\"><p class=\"question-label\">Exercise 10.2 · Q3</p><p class=\"question-prompt\">Using the fringe photograph and ruler below, estimate the width of the central bright fringe. State the two boundaries used.</p><figure class=\"problem\" data-print-keep=\"\"><img src=\"assets/10-2/exercise-q3.jpg\" width=\"575\" height=\"270\" alt=\"Original photograph for estimating the central bright-fringe width.\"><figcaption>Original photograph for estimating the central bright-fringe width.</figcaption></figure><div data-sheet-slot=\"exercise-3\" data-sheet-size=\"medium\" data-sheet-layout=\"block\" data-sheet-label-th=\"ภาพแถบแสงและไม้บรรทัดด้านล่าง: ความกว้างของแถบสว่างกลางมีค่าประมาณเท่าใด? ระบุขอบที่ใช้วัด\" data-sheet-label-en=\"Using the fringe photograph and ruler below, estimate the width of the central bright fringe. State the two boundaries used.\" style=\"--sheet-print-height:32mm\"><div data-sheet-answer=\"\">Measure between the two minima immediately bounding the central bright fringe. The approximate readings are 1.20 cm and 1.85 cm, so the width is about 0.65 cm. Do not measure the entire broad group of fringes.</div></div></div>"
